# Powerful Broker targeting a player: "give that permanent or player another counter of each kind". Bot1 has an experience counter (Otharri,
# Suns' Glory attacking), two energy counters (Rogue Refiner) and a poison counter (Bot2's Inkmoth Nexus hitting it), and the Broker
# gives it one more of each: experience 2, energy 3, poison 2 - and no kind it lacks.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gleemox
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Otharri, Suns' Glory
Rogue Refiner
Forest
Powerful Broker
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Inkmoth Nexus
Island x20

